    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Silent Hunters",
    "summary": "Making an **[advance move](vsdata:core-rule/advance-move)** does not make one of your **ANATHEMA PSYKANA** units ineligible to **[start an action](vsdata:core-rule/performing-actions)**. Those units also have **Ceaseless Vigilance**: during your **[Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase)**, the unit may pick one enemy unit it can see within 12\", and that enemy becomes **nulled**; a nulled unit's **detection range** grows by 3\". The card does not say how long a unit stays nulled.",
